    "selectable_floor_slice": "A usable horizontal slice of the main floor that can receive lesson content.",
    "logical_container": "A selectable-by-expansion grouping that cannot receive a card directly.",
    "landmark": "Context-only geometry or room feature. It cannot be a lesson-content destination."
  },
